* Process corners for
* benchmarks/design-agent/reference/relaxation-vco/vco.spice.
*
* Self-contained, PDK-free stand-in for a real .lib -- a copy of
* benchmarks/design-agent/reference/rc-relaxation-oscillator/models.lib's
* own corner_cap/corner_iref knobs (see that file's own header): the same
* two process knobs that set the RC relaxation oscillator's period also
* set both control points' periods here, since vco.spice's charge current
* is corner_iref-scaled and its timing capacitor is corner_cap-scaled
* identically for both vco_core instances. Replace this file with a real
* PDK model library (e.g. sky130's sky130.lib.spice) once the VCO is
* built out of real devices -- see README.md's "Known limitations" note.

.lib tt
.param corner_cap=1.00
.param corner_iref=1.00
.endl tt

.lib ss
.param corner_cap=1.10
.param corner_iref=0.95
.endl ss

.lib ff
.param corner_cap=0.90
.param corner_iref=1.05
.endl ff
